  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ECOWAS, TNCB Phase II, 2008-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECOWAS, TNCB,  Phase II, 2008-2015 - ECOWAS-TNCB Phase II 2008-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECOWAS Trade Negotiation Cap&#xe5;city Building - TNCB - Phase II. The     project shall contribute to increased capacity in the area of trade   policy in ECOWAS&apos; mamber states and in ECOWAS&apos; secretariate and thus  support regional integration. Expected results are: Common External   Tariff implemented, ECOWAS&apos; Trade Policy developed,                   Inter-Insttutional Committees established in Member Countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ECOWAS-Trade Negitiation Capacity Building - TNCB - Phase II.          Projectet skall bidra till &#xf6;kad kapacitet inom det handelspolitiska  omr&#xe5;det i ECOWAS&apos; medlemsl&#xe4;nder och inom ECOWAS&apos; sekretariat och      h&#xe4;rigenom fr&#xe4;mja regional integraton. F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade resultat &#xe4;r: Common  External Tariff genomf&#xf6;rd, ECOWAS&apos; Trade Policy utarbetad,            Inter-Institutional Committees uppbyggda i medlemsl&#xe4;nderna.</narrative>
  </description>
